{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54287","headline":"郑明府池亭 · 郑良士","name":"郑明府池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月魄星精称逸才，讼亭南面小亭开。\n啸猿洞里移松入，栖鹭湾中选石来。\n数处履痕侵绿甃，半街帘影护青苔。\n静留野客看云坐，多把清吟送酒杯。\n（《诗渊》第五册第三一三六页。\n原署郑昌士，爲良士之初名，见《十国春秋》卷九五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}